{
  "defaults": {
    "projects/*/worktrees/policy.toml": {
      "content": "creation_protocol = \"harness\"\nlifecycle = \"harness\"\npath_provider = \"host\"\nstorage_provider = \"host\"\nbranch_template = \"{type}/{slug}\"\nisolated_checkout = true\nagent_prefix = false\n",
      "sha256": "60b3283404b9bf721050cfe8250e4495cd55df038182009e2b8a3214e9369240"
    },
    "standards/branches.md": {
      "content": "# Branches\n\nChoose the task's primary Conventional Commit type once. Use `type/short-kebab-case-description` for its branch. Never add an agent, host, person, or machine prefix such as `codex/` or `claude/`.\n",
      "sha256": "cbde74ba450a4323db0990daa80afe58fb010e62f41301576ee71fe634f9b560"
    },
    "standards/commits.md": {
      "content": "# Commits\n\nUse English Conventional Commits: `type(scope): imperative description`. Use the Harness type vocabulary, lowercase types, and no final period. Classify each cohesive commit by its actual change.\n",
      "sha256": "0d0eeda123e8a8f9b4319e4bd31a25a2fd10015070635867c24e7ceee6263573"
    },
    "standards/pull-requests.md": {
      "content": "# Pull requests\n\nUse an English Conventional Commit title whose primary type matches the head branch type. Provide Goal, Desired behavior, Change map, Verification, Review focus, and Risks from the actual diff and evidence. Map changed responsibilities and review questions to precise paths or areas. Keep the body concise and do not publish from a host- or agent-prefixed branch.\n",
      "sha256": "1e6f7d8e84f98df333e47d91c8038ffe3271c0c67ca7c4ae3a03164d726857fb"
    },
    "standards/worktrees.md": {
      "content": "# Worktrees\n\nUse the task's semantic `type/short-kebab-case-description` branch in an isolated checkout. Let the active host choose the physical path, directory name, storage root, and native bookkeeping while Harness controls branch naming, creation, validation, adoption, and retirement. Host-specific directory names must not alter the branch. Git remains authoritative.\n",
      "sha256": "d1c9dd117c1a96a0d1eb20f2064880615ff851ad72715e2fd665c54a7502b50d"
    }
  },
